on.\n- Debugged and solved critical software issues by [methods used].\n\n---\n\n**Education**\n\n**Bachelor of Science in Computer Science**  \n[Your University], [Your City, State]  \n[Month Year] – [Month Year]  \n- Relevant Coursework: Algorithms, Data Structures, Software Engineering, Database Systems\n\n---\n\n**Projects**\n\n**[Project Name]**  \n- Developed a [describe the project] using [technologies used]. Key achievements: [list some key outcomes or skills demonstrated].\n- Improved the [specific aspect] by [quantifiable impact, if any].\n\n",
